  <entry>
    <title>安装音乐、追番页、Live2D看板娘</title>
    <link href="https://4lexcheng.github.io/posts/a99da82b.html"/>
    <id>https://4lexcheng.github.io/posts/a99da82b.html</id>
    <published>2025-11-03T15:15:43.000Z</published>
    <updated>2026-02-20T08:21:24.681Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<div class="note primary flat"><p>这篇文章聚焦博客“可玩性增强”：音乐页、追番页、Live2D。先保证能跑，再做美化。</p></div><h2 id="1-Live2D-看板娘"><a href="#1-Live2D-看板娘" class="headerlink" title="1. Live2D 看板娘"></a>1. Live2D 看板娘</h2><p>插件仓库：<a href="https://github.com/EYHN/hexo-helper-live2d">https://github.com/EYHN/hexo-helper-live2d</a></p><h3 id="1-1-安装依赖"><a href="#1-1-安装依赖" class="headerlink" title="1.1 安装依赖"></a>1.1 安装依赖</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install hexo-helper-live2d --save</span><br><span class="line">npm install live2d-widget-model-koharu --save</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="1-2-站点配置"><a href="#1-2-站点配置" class="headerlink" title="1.2 站点配置"></a>1.2 站点配置</h3><p>在根目录 <code>_config.yml</code> 添加：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">live2d:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">scriptFrom:</span> <span class="string">local</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">tagMode:</span> <span class="literal">false</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">debug:</span> <span class="literal">false</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">model:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">use:</span> <span class="string">live2d-widget-model-koharu</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">display:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">position:</span> <span class="string">right</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">width:</span> <span class="number">150</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">height:</span> <span class="number">300</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">mobile:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">show:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="1-3-验证效果"><a href="#1-3-验证效果" class="headerlink" title="1.3 验证效果"></a>1.3 验证效果</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo clean</span><br><span class="line">hexo generate</span><br><span class="line">hexo server</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>访问 <code>http://localhost:4000/</code>，检查页面右下角是否出现看板娘。</p><h2 id="2-音乐页（建议方案）"><a href="#2-音乐页（建议方案）" class="headerlink" title="2. 音乐页（建议方案）"></a>2. 音乐页（建议方案）</h2><p>可选做法：</p><ul><li>方案 A：使用主题内置音乐页能力（优先，改动最小）</li><li>方案 B：使用 APlayer + Meting 手动嵌入</li></ul><p>如果走方案 B，可先安装：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install hexo-tag-aplayer --save</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>然后在文章或页面中按插件语法插入播放器。</p><h2 id="3-追番页（建议方案）"><a href="#3-追番页（建议方案）" class="headerlink" title="3. 追番页（建议方案）"></a>3. 追番页（建议方案）</h2><p>常见做法是使用番剧页面插件，例如：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install hexo-bilibili-bangumi --save</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>安装后根据插件文档创建页面并填写数据源。</p><div class="note info flat"><p>追番页通常依赖第三方接口，首次配置建议先做最小可用版本，再逐步美化样式。</p></div><h2 id="4-故障排查"><a href="#4-故障排查" class="headerlink" title="4. 故障排查"></a>4. 故障排查</h2><h3 id="4-1-Live2D-不显示"><a href="#4-1-Live2D-不显示" class="headerlink" title="4.1 Live2D 不显示"></a>4.1 Live2D 不显示</h3><ul><li>确认 <code>live2d.enable: true</code></li><li>确认模型包已安装</li><li>先执行 <code>hexo clean</code> 再 <code>hexo generate</code></li><li>浏览器控制台查看是否有脚本加载错误</li></ul><h3 id="4-2-页面打开慢"><a href="#4-2-页面打开慢" class="headerlink" title="4.2 页面打开慢"></a>4.2 页面打开慢</h3><ul><li>降低 Live2D 模型尺寸</li><li>减少首页挂载的特效和第三方脚本</li><li>优先使用本地静态资源或稳定 CDN</li></ul><h2 id="5-发布建议"><a href="#5-发布建议" class="headerlink" title="5. 发布建议"></a>5. 发布建议</h2><p>每次新增插件后，建议执行：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo clean</span><br><span class="line">hexo generate</span><br><span class="line">hexo deploy</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><div class="note success flat"><p>这篇后续可以继续扩展成“博客功能增强合集”，统一维护所有插件配置。</p></div>]]></content>
    
    
    <summary type="html">为 Hexo 博客增加音乐页面、追番页面和 Live2D 看板娘的实用配置指南。</summary>
    
    
    
