  <entry>
    <title>SEO优化</title>
    <link href="https://4lexcheng.github.io/posts/c0d13edc.html"/>
    <id>https://4lexcheng.github.io/posts/c0d13edc.html</id>
    <published>2025-10-30T15:22:23.000Z</published>
    <updated>2026-02-20T08:21:05.580Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<div class="note primary flat"><p>这篇记录 Hexo 最实用的 SEO 基础配置，优先做“低成本、高收益”的优化项。</p></div><h2 id="1-参考资料"><a href="#1-参考资料" class="headerlink" title="1. 参考资料"></a>1. 参考资料</h2><ul><li>视频参考：<a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1oY4y1c7p2">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1oY4y1c7p2</a></li><li>Hexo 官方文档：<a href="https://hexo.io/docs/">https://hexo.io/docs/</a></li></ul><h2 id="2-优化文章链接（推荐）"><a href="#2-优化文章链接（推荐）" class="headerlink" title="2. 优化文章链接（推荐）"></a>2. 优化文章链接（推荐）</h2><p>目标：让文章链接更短、更稳定，便于分享和收录。</p><h3 id="2-1-安装插件"><a href="#2-1-安装插件" class="headerlink" title="2.1 安装插件"></a>2.1 安装插件</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install hexo-abbrlink --save</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>插件地址：<a href="https://github.com/ohroy/hexo-abbrlink">https://github.com/ohroy/hexo-abbrlink</a></p><h3 id="2-2-配置站点"><a href="#2-2-配置站点" class="headerlink" title="2.2 配置站点"></a>2.2 配置站点</h3><p>在 <code>_config.yml</code> 中添加（或确认）以下配置：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">permalink:</span> <span class="string">posts/:abbrlink.html</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">abbrlink:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">alg:</span> <span class="string">crc32</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">rep:</span> <span class="string">hex</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="3-开启本地搜索"><a href="#3-开启本地搜索" class="headerlink" title="3. 开启本地搜索"></a>3. 开启本地搜索</h2><p>目标：提高站内检索体验，也方便搜索引擎抓取结构化内容。</p><h3 id="3-1-安装插件"><a href="#3-1-安装插件" class="headerlink" title="3.1 安装插件"></a>3.1 安装插件</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install hexo-generator-search --save</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>插件地址：<a href="https://github.com/wzpan/hexo-generator-search">https://github.com/wzpan/hexo-generator-search</a></p><h3 id="3-2-配置站点"><a href="#3-2-配置站点" class="headerlink" title="3.2 配置站点"></a>3.2 配置站点</h3><p>在 <code>_config.yml</code> 中添加：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">search:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">path:</span> <span class="string">search.xml</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">field:</span> <span class="string">all</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">content:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="4-开启站点地图"><a href="#4-开启站点地图" class="headerlink" title="4. 开启站点地图"></a>4. 开启站点地图</h2><p>目标：帮助搜索引擎更高效发现你的页面。</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install hexo-generator-sitemap --save</span><br><span class="line">npm install hexo-generator-baidu-sitemap --save</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>生成后通常会出现：</p><ul><li><code>sitemap.xml</code></li><li><code>baidusitemap.xml</code></li></ul><h2 id="5-发布前检查清单"><a href="#5-发布前检查清单" class="headerlink" title="5. 发布前检查清单"></a>5. 发布前检查清单</h2><ul><li><code>url</code> 已设置为线上地址（例如 <code>https://4lexcheng.github.io/</code>）</li><li><code>permalink</code> 与 <code>abbrlink</code> 配置已生效</li><li><code>search.xml</code>、<code>sitemap.xml</code> 可正常生成</li><li>新文章包含明确标题、描述、标签、分类</li></ul><p>发布命令：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo clean</span><br><span class="line">hexo generate</span><br><span class="line">hexo deploy</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><div class="note success flat"><p>先把这 5 项做完，已经能覆盖大多数个人博客的 SEO 基础需求。</p></div>]]></content>
    
    
