  <entry>
    <title>踩坑</title>
    <link href="https://4lexcheng.github.io/posts/b7cf68d8.html"/>
    <id>https://4lexcheng.github.io/posts/b7cf68d8.html</id>
    <published>2025-09-29T15:57:04.000Z</published>
    <updated>2026-02-20T08:15:55.502Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<div class="note primary flat"><p>这篇文章按「准备环境 -&gt; 初始化项目 -&gt; 本地预览 -&gt; 线上部署 -&gt; 常见报错」整理，命令可直接复制执行。</p></div><h2 id="1-参考资料"><a href="#1-参考资料" class="headerlink" title="1. 参考资料"></a>1. 参考资料</h2><ul><li>视频教程：<a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ju4m1c7WR/">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ju4m1c7WR/</a></li><li>Hexo 官方文档：<a href="https://hexo.io/docs/">https://hexo.io/docs/</a></li></ul><h2 id="2-环境准备"><a href="#2-环境准备" class="headerlink" title="2. 环境准备"></a>2. 环境准备</h2><h3 id="2-1-安装-Node-js"><a href="#2-1-安装-Node-js" class="headerlink" title="2.1 安装 Node.js"></a>2.1 安装 Node.js</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 检查版本</span></span><br><span class="line">node -v</span><br><span class="line">npm -v</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="2-2-安装-Git"><a href="#2-2-安装-Git" class="headerlink" title="2.2 安装 Git"></a>2.2 安装 Git</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git -v</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="2-3-安装-Hexo-CLI"><a href="#2-3-安装-Hexo-CLI" class="headerlink" title="2.3 安装 Hexo CLI"></a>2.3 安装 Hexo CLI</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install -g hexo-cli</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><div class="note warning flat"><p>如果下载很慢或失败，可以临时切换 npm 镜像源：</p></div><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm config <span class="built_in">set</span> registry https://registry.npmmirror.com</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="3-创建-GitHub-仓库"><a href="#3-创建-GitHub-仓库" class="headerlink" title="3. 创建 GitHub 仓库"></a>3. 创建 GitHub 仓库</h2><p>创建用于页面托管的仓库：</p><ul><li>仓库名必须是：<code>用户名.github.io</code></li><li>可见性选择：<code>Public</code></li><li>可选：初始化 README</li></ul><h2 id="4-配置-SSH（推荐）"><a href="#4-配置-SSH（推荐）" class="headerlink" title="4. 配置 SSH（推荐）"></a>4. 配置 SSH（推荐）</h2><h3 id="4-1-生成密钥"><a href="#4-1-生成密钥" class="headerlink" title="4.1 生成密钥"></a>4.1 生成密钥</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">ssh-keygen -t rsa -C <span class="string">&quot;你的邮箱&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="4-2-配置到-GitHub"><a href="#4-2-配置到-GitHub" class="headerlink" title="4.2 配置到 GitHub"></a>4.2 配置到 GitHub</h3><ul><li>复制 <code>id_rsa.pub</code> 内容</li><li>打开 GitHub：<code>Settings -&gt; SSH and GPG keys</code></li><li>新增 SSH key 并保存</li></ul><h3 id="4-3-测试连通性"><a href="#4-3-测试连通性" class="headerlink" title="4.3 测试连通性"></a>4.3 测试连通性</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">ssh -T git@github.com</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>首次连接输入 <code>yes</code>。</p><h2 id="5-本地初始化-Hexo"><a href="#5-本地初始化-Hexo" class="headerlink" title="5. 本地初始化 Hexo"></a>5. 本地初始化 Hexo</h2><div class="note info flat"><p>项目目录名尽量使用英文、数字和下划线，避免中文或特殊字符引发路径问题。</p></div><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 1) 初始化</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo init</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 2) 安装依赖</span></span><br><span class="line">npm install</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 3) 新建文章</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo new <span class="string">&quot;我的文章&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 4) 生成静态文件</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo generate</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 5) 本地预览</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo server</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>本地访问：<code>http://localhost:4000/</code>（停止服务：<code>Ctrl + C</code>）。</p><h2 id="6-部署到-GitHub-Pages"><a href="#6-部署到-GitHub-Pages" class="headerlink" title="6. 部署到 GitHub Pages"></a>6. 部署到 GitHub Pages</h2><h3 id="6-1-配置部署信息"><a href="#6-1-配置部署信息" class="headerlink" title="6.1 配置部署信息"></a>6.1 配置部署信息</h3><p>编辑根目录 <code>_config.yml</code>：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">deploy:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">type:</span> <span class="string">git</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">repository:</span> <span class="string">https://github.com/4lexCheng/4lexCheng.github.io.git</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">branch:</span> <span class="string">main</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="6-2-执行部署"><a href="#6-2-执行部署" class="headerlink" title="6.2 执行部署"></a>6.2 执行部署</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo clean</span><br><span class="line">hexo generate</span><br><span class="line">hexo deploy</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="7-常见报错与处理"><a href="#7-常见报错与处理" class="headerlink" title="7. 常见报错与处理"></a>7. 常见报错与处理</h2><h3 id="7-1-报错：ERROR-Deployer-not-found-git"><a href="#7-1-报错：ERROR-Deployer-not-found-git" class="headerlink" title="7.1 报错：ERROR Deployer not found: git"></a>7.1 报错：<code>ERROR Deployer not found: git</code></h3><p>原因：没有安装 Git 部署插件。</p><p>处理：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install hexo-deployer-git --save</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>安装后重新执行：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo clean</span><br><span class="line">hexo generate</span><br><span class="line">hexo deploy</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="7-2-部署成功但页面未更新"><a href="#7-2-部署成功但页面未更新" class="headerlink" title="7.2 部署成功但页面未更新"></a>7.2 部署成功但页面未更新</h3><p>排查顺序：</p><ul><li>确认仓库名是否为 <code>用户名.github.io</code></li><li>确认 <code>deploy.repository</code> 和分支配置正确</li><li>等待 1-3 分钟后强刷浏览器缓存（<code>Ctrl + F5</code>）</li></ul><h2 id="8-上线前检查清单"><a href="#8-上线前检查清单" class="headerlink" title="8. 上线前检查清单"></a>8. 上线前检查清单</h2><ul><li>Node.js &#x2F; npm &#x2F; Git 版本正常</li><li><code>_config.yml</code> 中 <code>url</code> 已配置线上地址</li><li><code>_config.yml</code> 中 <code>deploy</code> 配置正确</li><li>已安装 <code>hexo-deployer-git</code></li><li>本地 <code>hexo server</code> 访问正常后再部署</li></ul><div class="note success flat"><p>按本文流程执行，基本可以稳定完成 Hexo 从本地到 GitHub Pages 的全流程发布。</p></div>]]></content>
    
    
